### AiDotNet host — C# / .NET benchmark API
# Start the host first (from aidotnet-benchmarks/):  dotnet run -c Release
# Binds https://localhost:7001 and http://localhost:7000 (Properties/launchSettings.json).
# The dev cert is self-signed — VS Code REST Client: set "rest-client.verifySSL": false.
#
# CSV uploads load from ../TestData/RegressionTestData/ (paths are relative to THIS file).

@host = https://localhost:7001

############################################################
# Benchmark — MLP / CNN / LSTM / Transformer
############################################################

### Readiness probe
GET {{host}}/api/Benchmark/Test

### Run the full four-model benchmark (no body) — takes minutes
POST {{host}}/api/Benchmark/Models?models=mlp,cnn,lstm,transformer&epochs=3&trainBatches=20&batchSize=64&inferenceIterations=100&warmupIterations=10&seed=1234

### Quick single-model smoke test
POST {{host}}/api/Benchmark/Models?models=mlp

############################################################
# CSV regression
############################################################

### Readiness probe (returns "ping")
GET {{host}}/api/Regression/Test

### SimpleRegression — single feature column (Simple/SmallSet)
# multipart boundary is declared inline; "< path" loads the file body.
POST {{host}}/api/Regression/SimpleRegression?UseGPU=false
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----AiDotNetBoundary

------AiDotNetBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="features"; filename="features.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../TestData/RegressionTestData/Simple/SmallSet/features.csv
------AiDotNetBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tests"; filename="tests.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../TestData/RegressionTestData/Simple/SmallSet/tests.csv
------AiDotNetBoundary--

### SimpleRegression — multiple feature columns (Complex/SmallSet)
# On the AiDotNet side this same route runs MultipleRegression<double> when
# features.csv has more than one feature column.
POST {{host}}/api/Regression/SimpleRegression?UseGPU=false
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----AiDotNetBoundary

------AiDotNetBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="features"; filename="features.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../TestData/RegressionTestData/Complex/SmallSet/features.csv
------AiDotNetBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tests"; filename="tests.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../TestData/RegressionTestData/Complex/SmallSet/tests.csv
------AiDotNetBoundary--

### SimpleRegression — large set (Complex/LargeSet)
POST {{host}}/api/Regression/SimpleRegression?UseGPU=false
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----AiDotNetBoundary

------AiDotNetBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="features"; filename="features.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../TestData/RegressionTestData/Complex/LargeSet/features.csv
------AiDotNetBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tests"; filename="tests.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../TestData/RegressionTestData/Complex/LargeSet/tests.csv
------AiDotNetBoundary--
